# Build context for deploy/Dockerfile.desk, which needs BOTH trees (the desk's app plus the
# three Baskfy packages). Allow-list, not deny-list: this directory holds `.env.staging`,
# `legacy/python/kite-momentum-rebalancer/.env`, `kite-momentum-rebalancer/data/portfolio.db` and the regression
# corpus, none of which may enter an image layer. Everything is excluded unless named below.
#
# `docker build legacy/python/decile-blueprint` (Dockerfile.python / Dockerfile.web) reads legacy/python/decile-blueprint's
# own .dockerignore, not this one.
*
!legacy/python/decile-blueprint/packages/core
!legacy/python/decile-blueprint/packages/execution
!legacy/python/decile-blueprint/packages/providers
!legacy/python/kite-momentum-rebalancer/app
!legacy/python/kite-momentum-rebalancer/config
!legacy/python/kite-momentum-rebalancer/scripts
!legacy/python/kite-momentum-rebalancer/requirements.txt
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/tests
**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.db
